{"title":"Alternating group","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>alternating group</b> on a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Finite\" title=\"Finite\">finite</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> is the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Group\" title=\"Group\">group</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Symmetric_group\" title=\"Symmetric group\"> even permutations</a> on the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />; it is denoted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/f/63fdc6f8d8ff2b15af4774874cc7b0bd43e2baa9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/3/783a89aa7f2e68f3bbf3eba64080e019be122b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathfrak{A}_M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"26\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/7/9476cb6aea6353f1bc3d7c4b0dab5ad24b2b90fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Alt}(M)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" />.  When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bdc961395a41b2a3d7c86e3ce6385f89b9ee8f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M = \\{1, \\dotsc, n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, this group is denoted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1eccfbd65334353f671fb71c27b9b9f2c689b0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b6170ca645986936c25ad649960219cc1a63f9f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathfrak{A}_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfcc05574d35b8266d12006e2d9b986752e560b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Alt}(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" />.  This is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Normal_subgroup\" title=\"Normal subgroup\">normal subgroup</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Symmetric_group\" title=\"Symmetric group\">symmetric group</a>; and for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/5635737307f5f0651cced8ee2e6558a426fd27b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=3$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/0207597a57c7acc72c46948c5e9397fcbc05855c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n\\ge 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, it is in fact a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Simple_group\" title=\"Simple group\">simple group</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/c/1eccfbd65334353f671fb71c27b9b9f2c689b0bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> is also the group of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Determinant\" title=\"Determinant\">determinant</a>-preserving permutations of the rows of an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/d/c3d38f82f48ef9e81c04d49354293305b0067afc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\times n$\" width=\"43\" height=\"9\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Matrix\" title=\"Matrix\">matrix</a>.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Alternating_group&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alternating_group&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Permutation\" title=\"Permutation\">Permutation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Symmetric_group\" title=\"Symmetric group\">Symmetric group</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Dihedral_group\" title=\"Dihedral group\">Dihedral group</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 85/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 292/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2258/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.928      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.928      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6925:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018072646 and revision id 172315. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}